    "updated_at": "2015-10-20T13:12:52Z",
    "body": "No they are actually different issues. This issue is about\n\n> The rel, hreflang, and type attributes may be used to indicate to the user the likely nature of the target resource before the user follows the link.\n\nFeed autodiscovery is actually implemented for `link` (but not for `a`/`area`, AFAIK).\n",
