    "created_at": "2015-10-29T00:51:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-29T00:51:09Z",
    "body": "On link elements, hreflang is interpreted in combination with rel='alternate' by search engines. It tells the search engine that the same content as in the current document is also available in the language given by hreflang. So the search engine can choose which version it lists depending on the language preference of the search engine's individual user.\n\nhttps://support.google.com/webmasters/answer/189077?hl=en\n",
